      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Due to their reduced size, Hobbits cannot use larger weapons effectively. The weapons available to Hobbits are:</p><p><i>Axe, bow, club, cudgel, dagger, short sword, short spear, spear. Additionally, Hobbits cannot use a great shield. </i></p><p><blockquote></blockquote></p></br><p>&nbsp;</p>",
