      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Sharp or better-balanced, this weapon is now more likely to produce a Piercing Blow when hitting its target.</p><p><i>Attack rolls made with a Keen weapon score a Piercing Blow also on a result of 9 on the Feat die.</i></p></br><p>&nbsp;</p>",
