      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Hard and straight, a Piercing Blow from a Fell weapon is stopped less easily by a suit of armour.</br>A weapon that can be wielded with one or two hands gets the bonus to both its Injury ratings.</p><p><i>Add 2 to the Injury rating of the selected weapon.</i></p></br><p>&nbsp;</p>",
