        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>(General)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>TRAVEL and RIDDLE</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You have practised certain skills until they have become as natural as breathing.</p>\n<p><em>Choose two Skills and make them Favoured.</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
